          <block type="serial_text">
            <field name="TEXT">@msg The servo scans 30–150 degrees. XY shows distance against angle; it is an angle/distance plot, not a Cartesian radar image. First measurement waits 100 ms after positioning. Press Start to begin; Stop pauses readings.</field>
